{{PageBanner|Clb_l_010_1_en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular magical girl anime known as '''Puella Magi Madoka Magica''' (魔法少女まどか☆マギカ, ''Mahō Shōjo Madoka ☆ Magika'', '''Puella Magi Madoka☆Magica''') was originally held from October 17th, 2016 to October 31st, 2016. The collaboration includes an [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The anime is published by [[wikipedia:Aniplex|Aniplex]].

==Event Information==
The Magical Girls of {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part 1: Beginnings", "Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part 2: Eternal", and "Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -Rebellion- "'''}} return to The Battle Cats for another spectacular Collab Event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from February 24, 2025 (11:00AM) until March 10, 2025 (10:59AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Limited "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
For a short time only, select the Puella Magi Madoka Magica set at the Rare Capsule menu to recruit awesome magical girl heroes into your Cat Army!

New unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Madoka Cat & Homura'''}} has been added! Also, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Homura Akemi, Madoka Kaname, Nagisa & Cat'''}} have been given new {{Color|#34A853|'''True Forms'''}}!
Don't miss out on the chance to add these magical girls to your Cat Army!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Collab-only Units available in this set include:'''}}<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''Madoka Cat & Homura (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
100% chance to Knockback and Curse Floating and Aliens and unleashes Mini-Surges!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
A long-range specialist delivering powerful anti-Floating attacks with 100% chance of Slow!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Homura Akemi (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks have a chance to Freeze Black enemies!<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Can only attack enemies at a distance, but has superior range and delivers massive damage vs Angels!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Sayaka Miki (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Her area attacks gain power as she takes damage, and she survives one lethal attack!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks have a chance to knockback and weaken Red enemies!<br>
{{Color|#0B5394|'''Bebe (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks with 100% chance to weaken Aliens and Zombies!<br>
Level it up to reveal its evolution into {{Color|#0B5394|'''Nagisa and Cat!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''Kyubey (Super Rare)'''}}<br>
Tough vs Aliens, with a chance to survive lethal attacks!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Madoka Cat, Sayaka Cat, Mami Cat, Kyoko Cat, Homura Cat (Rare)'''}}<br>
Battle Cat reimaginings of your favorite magical girls!<br>
Don't miss out!

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" collab units from the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" capsule set. "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Collab Maps in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Challenge specials stages to destroy the witches' labyrinth! "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" characters appear as enemies! Visit the Legend Stories to take on these limited edition event maps!<br>
Some stages have {{Color|#4A86E8|'''new difficulty levels added, Timed Score rewards added, and have their clear rewards reset'''}}!

※If the Madoka Magica collab stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● New difficulty and Timed Score Rewards added to collab stages Be a Magical Girl and Be a Magical Girl II!'''}}<br>
Clear {{Color|#FF0000|'''Be a Magical Girl'''}} stages for a small chance to earn {{Color|#9900FF|'''Li'l Madoka'''}}, with a higher chance after clearing later stages!<br>
Clear {{Color|#FF0000|'''Be a Magical Girl II'''}} stages for a small chance to earn {{Color|#9900FF|'''Kyubey Cat'''}}, with a higher chance after clearing later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''new difficulty levels and Timed Score Rewards'''}} have been added to these stages!

※Li'l Madoka and Kyubey Cat have a 100% chance to be collected by using a Treasure Radar.<br>
※If Li'l Madoka and Kyubey Cat have been collected from a previous event, then they cannot be collected again.<br>
※Li'l Madoka and Kyubey Cat can be collected from the Rare unit section of the Upgrade Menu.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● New difficulty and Timed Score Rewards added to collab stage WItch's Labyrinth!'''}}<br>
Enjoy collab-only stages with Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -Rebellion- backgrounds and themes on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Rose Garden Witch, The Dessert Witch'''}}, and{{Color|#FF0000|'''The Box Witch'''}}stages!

During this crossover event, stages featuring terrifying Witch enemies will appear on a blitz schedule at the times below. You won't know which Witch will be attacking until you enter the map!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''6:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～2:59pm / 7:00pm～10:59pm'''}}}

Defeat the Witches to gain{{Color|#93C47D|'''huge XP rewards'''}}!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''new difficulty levels have been added and stage clear rewards have been reset for these stages'''}}! If you've cleared these stages in a previous collab event, clear them again for even more rewards!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Collab Map "Walpurgisnacht"'''}}<br>
The "Walpurgisnacht" stage will appear {{Color|#FF0000|'''starting Day 3 of the collab (Feb 27 11:00AM)'''}}! Can you defeat this Deadly challenge?!

A new gauntlet stage is available during the Madoka Magica collab event! Overcome the neverending fight with the witches!

There are a total of {{Color|#9900FF|'''10 stage levels'''}}, and tougher enemies appear in higher stage levels! Clear the first stage level to unlock {{Color|#34A853|'''Li'l Madoka's True Form'''}}!

Also, the first stage level has had {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Timed Score Rewards added'''}}!

※Li'l Madoka must be at Lv. 20 in order to evolve into its True Form.<br>
※Even if Li'l Madoka has not been unlocked, Li'l Madoka can be evolved into its True Form once it has been earned and this stage has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Collab Map "Nutcracker Witch"'''}}<br>
The "Nutcracker Witch" stage will appear {{Color|#FF0000|'''starting Day 6 of the collab (March 1 11:00AM)'''}}! Can you defeat this Deadly challenge?!

Clear this stage level to unlock {{Color|#34A853|'''Li'l Homura's True Form'''}} and a Rare Ticket!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Timed Score Rewards have been added'''}}!

※Li'l Homura must be at Lv. 20 in order to evolve into its True Form.<br>
※Even if Li'l Homura has not been unlocked, Li'l Homura can be evolved into its True Form once it has been earned and this stage has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn cool bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Puella Magi Madoka Magica events!

※Puella Magi Madoka Magica Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until March 10, 2025 at 10:59AM. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Login each day for another login stamp!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and unlock a {{Color|#9900FF|'''Rare Ticket'''}} or useful battle items.

※ Up to 14 Stamps can be collected during this event.

