==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]], many of the stages were different:
**'''Be A Magical Girl''' was originally called '''Puella Magi Madoka Magica'''.
**Witch's Labyrinth stages only included two levels rather than five and went by different names.
***Additionally, they would drop [[Kyubey Cat (Rare Cat)|Kyubey Cat]] instead of XP.
**[[A Fake Mitakihara]] originally had two stages rather than five.
**[[Walpurgisnacht]] was originally one stage rather than a [[Gauntlet]].

